WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.240
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.260
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.290
Just a little more,

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.180
Just a little bit more,

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:16.720
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:27.550
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:31.760
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:36.490
You smiled at me,

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:42.520
Like a leaf swaying in the wind.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:49.240
It seems as though my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:54.330
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:57.020
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:59.160
Just a little more,

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:01.050
Just a little bit more,

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:04.970
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:09.620
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.820
And understand what I'm saying to you!

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:16.640
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:21.660
This excitement will never stop!

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:37.450
Hey! Why don't you say something?

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:42.030
Don't play dumb with us!

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:46.040
Why don't you go somewhere else? You're a nuisance.

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:48.500
Quit screwing with us!

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:53.670
You bastards...

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:56.720
Get him!

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:14.190
Kobayashi Butcher

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:24.200
Kobayashi Butcher

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:32.380
Inukai-sempai...

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:55.650
Haruka-sensei sure is late.

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:58.950
The Exciting Rain

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:58.030
Yeah. Did she oversleep?

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:00.660
You know, it's almost lunch.

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:03.240
There's no way she could oversleep this long.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.660
But she's really late.

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:08.450
Did you hear anything about this, Sayuri?

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:11.580
No. I wonder what happened.

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:15.750
Sorry I'm late, everyone.

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:22.130
That's how it is, so please be good while I'm gone.

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:28.390
What's going on?

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:30.350
Maybe something really did happen.

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:30.900
Self-Study

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:33.890
Self-Study

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:34.400
Hey, Aoba, what do you think happened?

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:35.360
Dunno.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:37.690
Oh, don't you know?

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:38.360
Yuusuke!

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:40.150
Do you know something?

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.410
I guess.

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:45.990
Hey, tell us now!

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:48.240
Don't panic.

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:49.370
Just a bit longer.

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:52.000
Headline: Strange visitor seen in a river in the Tsumugino River. Tsumu-chan the seal.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:53.580
Headline: Tsumugino Town.
High school students had a fight in the park.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:55.000
Found it!

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.090
This is it.

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:00.920
Headline: Tsumugino Town.
High school students had a fight in the park.

00:03:59.570 --> 00:04:01.830
Strange visitor seen in a river in the Tsumugino River. Tsumu-chan the seal.

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:03.550
Tsumugino Town. High school students had a fight in the park.

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:03.720
Did something happen there?

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:07.640
To be honest, I heard that Inukai-kun was involved in the fight.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:10.850
Tsumugino Town. High school students had a fight in the park.

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:08.970
Inukai got in a fight?

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:23.530
Hey! Why don't you say something?

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:30.000
Guidance Counseling

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:30.160
Say, Inukai-kun, you must've had a reason, right?

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:32.250
Please tell us.

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:35.580
Shut it.

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:39.300
Inukai-kun.

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:41.670
You can't go easy on him.

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:43.420
He's that kind of guy.

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:47.800
Understand, Inukai? I don't mind if you don't want to answer me.

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:52.350
But, don't forget that you'll be punished for it.

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.230
Don't bring your filthy face so close to mine.

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:57.440
What did you say?!

00:04:57.440 --> 00:05:01.030
Don't resort to violence, Akaboshi-sensei!

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:04.030
As long as I'm here, as the headmaster...

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:05.490
Behave yourselves.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:09.830
We don't know the full story, so we should let him go this time.

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:17.080
But you know what we'll do if this happens again, right?

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:18.790
O-Of course.

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:21.000
Right? It's okay, right, Inukai-kun?

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.010
Wait! Where are you going?

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:30.810
Inukai-kun!

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:34.100
Young people these days.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:37.400
I have no idea what they're thinking.

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:40.860
Don't worry about it, Wakatake-sensei.

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:42.570
It's his fault!

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:45.280
But...

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:50.780
In any case, his everyday behavior is a problem!

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:53.740
He's rebellious, and he skips class!

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:57.000
Did you hear about Inukai-kun from Class A?

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:59.290
I heard he got arrested by the police.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:00.210
I knew it!

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:01.630
Rumors have been going around for a while.

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:03.250
He's been hanging around with the wrong crowd!

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:06.800
I heard he used to get into fights all the time.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:09.260
He doesn't seem to go to class very often.

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:11.100
Honestly, what is he thinking?

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:25.110
Geez, what a pain in the ass.

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:34.330
And so, all the rumors about Inukai-kun have been negative ones.

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:36.330
No kidding.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:40.500
Sometimes I don't know what he's thinking.

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:42.250
Inukai-kun.

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:49.180
Back then...

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:01.810
I'm sure he saved us back then.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:04.480
What's wrong, Aoba?

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:08.400
You were daydreaming. Are you thinking about something?

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:10.150
Oh, no.

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:11.450
Not really.

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:13.870
Well then.

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:15.160
Let's have lunch.

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:16.660
Good idea.

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:19.410
Let's talk some more about Inukai-kun.

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:26.050
I'd like to join your group.

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:28.010
D-Doujima-kun!

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:29.260
Why are you here?

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:31.220
Do you want to eat lunch with us?

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:34.050
Don't be shy. Okay?

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:39.730
Let's go, my friends!

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:57.240
Inukai! Where the hell are you?!

00:07:57.870 --> 00:07:59.500
I-Ishiuchi-san!

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.460
What happened all of a sudden?

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:03.670
Who cares about that?!

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:07.960
Inukai got into a fight, didn't he?!

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:10.800
But that's just a rumor...

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:12.090
Shut up!

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:19.720
If we let him go on like this, our baseball club won't be able to participate in competitions due to his behavior.

00:08:21.230 --> 00:08:25.100
I'm gonna kill him before the end of our summer season!

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:27.150
Hey! Ishiuchi-san!

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:29.780
Inukai-kun isn't here right now.

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:33.490
Liar!

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:34.820
Find him at once!

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:42.210
Find him! I'll knock his head off!

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:45.710
H-Hey! Help me grab him!

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:54.720
This is violent enough to warrant a punishment.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:19.620
Art Room

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:18.830
Huh? Mo-chan?

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.500
I'm sure that's...

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:32.710
Huh?

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:35.970
Eh?

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:46.310
Inukai-kun didn't come back after all.

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:50.360
I wanted to ask him about that.

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:51.980
Riku-kun!

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:53.360
Oh, Kasuga-san.

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:55.190
Going home?

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:56.860
Come on, let's go home together.

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:59.820
I-I don't mind.

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:06.160
S-Sorry!

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:07.580
I'll have to do it some other time!

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:13.250
He's been acting so cold to me lately!

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:15.590
He's supposed to be my boyfriend!

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:21.970
Quit it!

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:24.430
Was that Inukai-kun?

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:25.520
Quit struggling!

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:27.270
Don't look at me like that!

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:29.480
Did he get into a fight again?

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:31.420
Wait, Riku-kun

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:33.320
Hiyoko-kun!

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:34.730
I've gotta stop Inukai-kun!

00:10:36.050 --> 00:10:36.990
Look carefully.

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:43.030
I said, quit struggling!

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:44.660
I can't bandage your wound.

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:54.880
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love.

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:59.880
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love. I'm Aikawa Momo.

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:04.640
Aoba-kun.

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:05.970
Here.

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:07.430
Amamiya-san.

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:08.600
Here.

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:10.100
Inukai-kun.

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:24.990
Oh, Inukai-kun.

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:29.000
I wonder what happened to him.

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:35.670
Tsumugino High School. Class 2A Attendance Record

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:35.670
Name. Attendance.

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:35.670
Aoba. Amamiya. Inukai.

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:35.670
Official absence.

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:34.750
You there!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.710
You're from class 2A, right?

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:39.550
Iyagen-sensei!

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:40.760
Here!

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:44.300
You're stressed.

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:46.640
Your health is poor.

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:47.930
I have a drink to fix that!

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:50.310
I-I'm fine!

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:52.400
I see. That is unfortunate.

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:55.570
Well, I have something to ask of you.

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:58.360
As long as it's not an experiment...

00:11:58.610 --> 00:11:59.610
Yes.

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:01.860
To be honest...

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:09.250
He asked me to get back the skeleton from the art room for the afternoon class.

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:11.210
Why do I have to?

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:15.540
Aoba-san.

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:17.340
Oh, Yayoi-san.

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:18.050
Are you having lunch?

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:20.300
I've finished my lunch.

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:24.550
It's unusual to see you here.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:27.100
I have something to do in the art room.

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:30.730
Um... May I join you?

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:32.730
Oh, I don't mind.

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:35.310
I just came to bring a sample to the science room.

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:39.150
I-I want to thank you for watching me train every day.

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:40.110
I'll help.

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:42.450
All right. Thank you.

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:44.700
Yes!

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:53.620
Let's see... Where is it?

00:12:53.920 --> 00:12:55.830
Oh, isn't that it?

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:56.540
Look.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.920
Will this be all right?

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:03.340
The arms and legs are on backwards...

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:08.260
This...

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:09.390
What is it, Yayoi-san?

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:17.610
Um... About this drawing...

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:18.940
Drawing?

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:19.730
This is...

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:24.110
Wow!

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:25.860
It's lovely.

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:28.370
I wonder who drew this.

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:29.030
Don't!

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:30.660
Don't touch that drawing!

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:34.370
Mo-chan?

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:35.870
Do you know her?

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:38.380
Yes. She's Aikawa Momo-chan.

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:39.960
She's in the Art Club.

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:42.800
Say, why can't we touch it?

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:46.590
That drawing is important to Inukai-kun!

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:48.050
Inukai-senpai drew that, so you can't touch it!

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:49.600
It's Inukai-kun's drawing?

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:56.440
I-Inukai-kun!

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:58.860
What are you doing here?

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:03.900
Oh, Iyagen-sensei asked us to do something here...

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:05.780
Then do it and get out.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:07.030
You're in the way.

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:09.200
I-Inukai-senpai!

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:12.240
I didn't thank you for the other day yet...

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:12.990
Shut up!

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:13.700
Don't say any more.

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:20.040
Say, Inukai-kun, did you draw that?

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:21.920
It's a lovely drawing.

00:14:25.470 --> 00:14:26.970
Don't, Inukai-senpai!

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:29.220
Move.

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:32.310
Don't, Inukai-kun!

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:33.850
You moron!

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:53.740
Inukai... kun?

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:04.340
Say, Hiyoko-kun.

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:09.510
What kind of person is Inukai-kun?

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:12.010
He can be kind and scary.

00:15:12.630 --> 00:15:13.880
That sort of thing, huh?

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:16.550
You should already know that, right?

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:25.320
That's right.

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:31.700
It's all my fault.

00:15:32.370 --> 00:15:37.580
Because I made trouble for Inukai-senpai, his precious drawing is...

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:38.910
I'll help too.

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:42.380
A-Aoba-san?

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:45.920
This happened because I got Inukai-kun mad.

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:47.260
So I'll help too.

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:50.720
But...

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:53.430
Say, how do you fix it?

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:58.350
I could fix it if it was a canvas, but this was drawn on paper, so...

00:15:58.520 --> 00:16:03.100
Should we use glue or tape to attach it to an extra sheet of paper and make it solid?

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:04.270
Something like that?

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:05.690
Yes!

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:10.200
You were talking about "the other day" earlier. What was that about?

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:13.410
Th-That's...

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:15.490
I see.

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:17.700
I'm sorry.

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:19.330
Don't worry about it.

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:21.160
Come on. Let's keep going.

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:22.710
Yes!

00:16:38.730 --> 00:16:40.730
How to Fix a Painting

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:45.560
It really is hard to fix a drawing.

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:48.380
Chikyu Store

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:52.280
Was that Aikawa-san?

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:55.240
Does she have a pet at home?

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:57.200
Hey, Aikawa-san!

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:58.080
Pet Store

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:58.080
Doggies and Kitties

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:03.920
I didn't know there was a park here.

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:08.300
Oh, it's raining.

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:14.840
Why did it start raining so suddenly?

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:16.180
Aoba-san?

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:18.260
Aikawa-san!

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:24.730
Inukai-kun was trying to save you?

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:30.530
The other day, I came here to feed this kitten, and some bad guys attacked me.

00:17:30.530 --> 00:17:31.490
That was when...

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:33.200
I see.

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:38.410
Say, do you feed him here?

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:44.750
Well, I think he was living here all along, and I wanted to take him home, but he didn't want to leave.

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:54.590
It looks like the rain's letting up.

00:17:56.640 --> 00:17:59.180
Yo. You caused quite some trouble for us the other day.

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:02.100
Isn't Inukai with you today?

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:05.190
Oh, you're with someone else today.

00:18:05.190 --> 00:18:06.440
Such a cute face.

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:07.730
He's not what I expected.

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:10.320
Wh-Who are you guys?!

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:12.900
A-Aoba-san.

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:14.610
These were the guys from the other day.

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:20.660
Cut it out.

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:27.830
We're only after Inukai.

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:29.670
Don't forget that.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:32.130
I'll try to buy you some time.

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:34.630
Take the kitten and get out of here.

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:35.880
B-But...

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:36.680
Just go!

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:39.260
What's he up to?

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:40.850
Hey! Quit screwing around!

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:41.720
Aikawa-san!

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:47.690
I-Inukai-senpai!

00:18:48.190 --> 00:18:52.150
Oh, you hugged me without confessing your love to me.

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:53.820
You're bolder than I expected.

00:18:57.610 --> 00:18:58.530
Inukai!

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:01.740
We let you get away before, but we won't let that happen again!

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:04.870
Don't say such crap. Bring it on!

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:06.620
Take this!

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:10.420
Why you!

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:11.000
Be quiet!

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:17.760
You...

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:20.510
Shit!

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:23.970
Look out, Inukai-kun!

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:28.060
Who the hell are you?

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:31.100
I'm Inukai-kun's friend!

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:33.440
Hey! Don't say such needless things.

00:19:34.070 --> 00:19:36.320
But I can't just leave you here.

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:39.280
I don't know what's going to happen.

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:41.410
My thoughts exactly!

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:45.410
I guess you're ready.

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:47.200
We'll make you regret it!

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:53.040
I'm gonna run for it!

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:58.010
You come too!

00:19:58.760 --> 00:19:59.220
Look out!

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:00.380
Hey!

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:14.770
Are you all right, Inukai-kun?

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:18.190
You worry about others even when you're so worn-out.

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:19.950
You really are a bother.

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:25.080
Well, you suddenly started running, so that's why...

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:28.870
It's too much trouble for me to look after you.

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:30.750
Hey, are you all right?

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:32.330
Oh, yes!

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:35.340
Not you. The kitten.

00:20:38.260 --> 00:20:38.590
Here.

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:45.470
Now you don't have anywhere to live anymore.

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:47.720
Inukai-kun, are you...

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:48.640
Are you just going to leave him here?

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:55.150
Oh, in that case...

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:08.950
Thank goodness. I guess he likes this place.

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:19.670
Thanks to Aikawa, this misunderstanding has been completely cleared up.

00:21:20.010 --> 00:21:21.130
That's a relief.

00:21:23.430 --> 00:21:25.720
Well, I don't care either way.

00:21:29.310 --> 00:21:30.560
And this...

00:21:33.890 --> 00:21:36.060
We could only fix it like this.

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:42.780
Let me see it when it's finished.

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:47.910
Inukai-kun?

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:00.090
You're such a bother.

00:22:13.480 --> 00:22:17.020
I'll let you see it when it's finished.

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:37.210
When the morning sunlight streams through the window,

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:42.250
I immediately think of you.

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:54.220
Our love began at first sight.

00:22:55.140 --> 00:23:00.230
We have a bright future!

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:06.650
Because you are my destined man!

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:17.330
I've always been searching for the feeling which broke my smile.

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:24.340
I have grasped a piece of the miracle which fell into this world

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:30.260
I will run toward you, my love!

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:35.930
When we are together, we can overcome any obstacle!

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:42.560
Our love is still young, but it's my treasure!

00:23:50.990 --> 00:23:53.910
Say, Mii-chan, have you confessed your love to Aoba-kun?

00:23:53.910 --> 00:23:55.910
Mo-chan! Why'd you say that so suddenly?

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:57.790
Geez, I guess it can't be helped.

00:23:57.790 --> 00:24:00.120
Then I'll confess in your place.

00:23:59.920 --> 00:24:02.420
Next Episode Preview

00:23:59.920 --> 00:24:30.000
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love

00:24:00.120 --> 00:24:01.500
I-In my place?!

00:24:01.500 --> 00:24:03.210
What are you going to do?

00:24:03.460 --> 00:24:05.750
Well, I'll ask him to come behind the gym...

00:24:05.800 --> 00:24:07.090
Heh, heh, heh...

00:24:07.090 --> 00:24:09.760
This is just between you and me.

00:24:09.880 --> 00:24:10.470
And then...

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:13.050
