00:24:13.510 --> 00:24:14.760
An Exciting Confession.

00:24:14.760 --> 00:24:15.930
Please watch!

00:24:16.720 --> 00:24:19.310
That's confidential, Mo-chan!

00:24:23.320 --> 00:24:30.000
